OL,3,AChris Brown sentenced to eight months
OL,4,Ain prison, suspended for a year, over
OL,5,ALondon nightclub attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDelivering his sentencing remarks,
OL,8,FJudge Tony Baumgartner says "the
OL,9,Frepeated use" of a bottle was "plainly
OL,10,Fdangerous"
OL,12,FAcknowledging the incident was "short",
OL,13,Fthe judge says it was also "intense".
OL,14,FEarlier, defence barristers said this
OL,15,Fwas an "ugly and unattractive
OL,16,Fincident", adding it "was very
OL,17,Fshort-lived"
OL,19,FBrown's vocal coach, 40-year-old
OL,20,FOmololu Akinlolu, a rapper from
OL,21,FFlorida, also pleaded guilty to affray
OL,22,F- he is being sentenced too
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
